{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/TiP22QeWdpa6944y0mgPHA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:31.248490+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/TiP22QeWdpa6944y0mgPHA","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/3IAn9ibNXb55FUn9lLHwY8TaVLzlVWEdCWkCR4cibakJMjBSoAAica9ias7s1vX61Cpcx06aeqoE1GFib3bXJz8cib1N5twhQsyWDnpCZhMzubApw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/3IAn9ibNXb54MCcHOOVWelf59mZFJUIxbjia6tuJNiauQ4AQ8BztjaMcZ24icTfTD8IEeYpQOv5lopHKBC2kNOK1Q8H6ChF4TvTEpJiaACC3VjuY/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>学院简介</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.深圳大学政府管理学院拥有公共管理学、政治学两个一级学科硕士点；公共管理硕士（MPA）、社会工作硕士（MSW）两个专业学位硕士点；社会工作专业学位博士点、政治传播学二级学科博士点。</span></p><p><span>2.学院现有在职教师60人，其中教授16人、副教授25人、讲师或助理教授19人。其中，万人计划领军人才2人，中宣部文化名家暨“四个一批人才”3人，国家百千万人才工程1人，教育部新世纪优秀人才2人，教育部教学指导委员会委员1人，深圳市高层次专业人才及鹏城孔雀计划特聘岗位36人，深圳大学领军学者、荔园优秀学者、荔园优青7人。其中博导（含留学博导）32名，硕导56名，98%以上教师拥有博士学位，62%以上教师拥有海外留学经历。</span></p><p><span>3.学院研究团队围绕“高层次科研项目、高水平学术论文、高档次科研获奖、高级别咨政报告、高规格学术活动”产出了一批高质量科研成果。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/3IAn9ibNXb55tZy3jLLN58p6j7LzicCJRibWxP1jRSVIrwesWialWA63NU48SqQALWpzlLtcyiann0ojCaHrpyqibna2hibIrDgicJg4BFiaKhJm5q7Y/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/3IAn9ibNXb57gVaqX7kSB1ibLWBjFRbo8k3I4sKGQK0kpbcEZ70LzleThViawsQvea1DbbGxqtnyydx8CM5WQZS7SO0jvvwbt7OY4f2pb3RusU/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>4.学院注重科研团队建设，现有1个部级重点研究基地、5个省级研究基地，3个市级人文社科重点研究基地，以平台促进科学研究、人才培养、教学教研一体化发展。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/3IAn9ibNXb56ia8LLfDRd22aUTRia5FelMEbPAykaGm1ibZicQ3iavYgSqW9esnerrdsuqIonKr0aKBQQw3ZqBJKQUvrOrywZDPtDlxgVHbZQCkcw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>宣传视频</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>2027年接收推免生招生专业</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/3IAn9ibNXb56CgHg8sQ6dCHK9EZbveBtsBLpV91vcNoH4P8BMbS3eWdUTtsnUbS0hnOkke9P6Tz8WuNqDDVNssWlHJ4SUAr64EjibdcEQ19SE/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>咨询方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section></secti